  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 507.02 One-Third Rate Vehicle Registration",
  "priorExpiration": "2012-03-15",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 507.02 One-Third Rate Vehicle Registration.\n\n(a) Each applicant for a one-third rate registration shall verbally request the registration, at the time the applicant applies for a municipal permit or upon renewal of the applicant’s registration.\n\n(b) If the applicant is required to register in accordance with RSA 260:73 because they meet the Federal Motor Carrier Safety Administration definition of interstate commerce and fall under the International Registration Plan, a one-third rate registration shall not be issued.\n\nSource. #7972, eff 10-17-03 (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 500); ss by #9995, INTERIM, eff 9-17-11, EXPIRED: 3-15-12\n\nNew. #10135, eff 5-23-12; ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (formerly Saf-C 508.02)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c500.html"
